※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4679
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4679 LANG_RESUME_NOT_RUNNING

※ A generator's call describes a walk; `⎕start` makes one under way, which is
※ what `⎕resume` moves on.

fn acc(start: u64) ⇉ u64 ⇇ u64:
    let more := yield start
    yield more

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let a := ⎕resume(acc(1u64), 2u64)
    0u6
